              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Nebukadrezani fulla ibida kaani d'ufe, worra kaani yaame waan jed'e Shadraka, Mesheki, Abednego. Hojattu Waaqa gudda, gabaha! Jennaani worri hojuma suni ibida suni keesaa yae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani jara gugurdafi jaarole gugurdofi makalootafi jari hayyu gugurdaani kaani ch'ufti wolti gad'ufe, jara sadeeni kaani ka ibidi gubu dad'abe dawate. Rifeensafi woyaani worraleeni tokoleeni ingubanne nafi worraleeni diqole aara ind'au.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
