        {
          "text": "Anini amma seera baasa: Yo nami gosafi d'alootafi afaani tateefu Waaqa Shadrakatifi ka Meshekitifi ka Abednego tufate arabse, nama suni ha harkaafi miila iraa ch'irani mana isale onsani balleesaniti. Waaqi d'ibiini tokoleeni ka dandae akana nama baasu injiru.",
